@*
    What a commit moves on in the Valuation section, carried forward by the
    script after every commit. The calculator renders it while editing, and a
    commit answered in place renders it again.

    - selection.Opening: the calculation the last commit recorded. A commit
      records a calculation that differs from it.
    - The saved state (operator, 6 October 2026): the section head's figure
      and the recorded calculation's source as the Case now holds them, so
      the head and the Engineer's Value label follow each save without a
      reload. It is disabled, so it posts nothing.
*@
@model Pegasus.Web.Pages.Cases.DetailsModel
<input type="hidden" name="selection.Opening" value="@Model.OpeningValuationCanonical" form="case-edit-form" data-carry-forward />
<input type="hidden" name="valuationSaved" value="@Model.ValuationSaved" form="case-edit-form" disabled data-carry-forward data-valuation-recorded-state />
